    "title": "Downtown Jackson businesses prepare for holiday shoppers - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By Jay Green, 39 News ,\n10 hours ago The holiday shopping season is nearly here, and local businesses in the downtown Jackson area are doing what they can to help the people of the community. “I think it's great. I think we have really good prices for, especially for this time of the year. I think it's, readily available for everybody, and I think it's a good, it's a good way to get people in and connect with the community,\" said Naji and Bonnie, two Deli clerks at Grubbs Grocery. Read full article\nRead in NewsBreak",
